@startuml UC-14 核销处方
actor 药师
boundary "核销接口" as DispenseController
control "处方核销服务" as DispenseAppService
control "处方状态机" as PrescriptionStateMachine
entity "处方仓储" as PrescriptionRepository
entity "流转记录仓储" as FlowRecordRepository
药师 -> DispenseController : 提交处方核销（版本号）
DispenseController -> DispenseAppService : 核销(处方编号, 药师, 版本)
DispenseAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 查询处方
DispenseAppService -> DispenseAppService : 校验待核销且未过期
DispenseAppService -> PrescriptionStateMachine : 执行核销迁移
DispenseAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 按版本更新为已核销
DispenseAppService -> FlowRecordRepository : 追加核销记录
DispenseAppService --> DispenseController : 返回成功或冲突
@enduml
